There are 10 quarts of tea left from the party. 1.5 quarts of tea were drunk by each of four students and 2 quarts of tea were drunk by each of sixteen students. How many gallons of tea were at the beginning of the party?,There are 10 quarts of tea left from the party. Four students each drank 1.5 quarts of tea and 16 students each drank 2 quarts of tea. How many gallons of tea were at the beginning of the party?,12,12,12,12,"- Tea consumed by four students: 4 × 1.5 = 6 quarts
